      "content": "thanks for the technical list. that's more helpful. one thing though—the technician just called and said the rattle is coming from inside the condenser housing and it sounds almost like something is physically caught in the fan blades, but when they look, they can't see anything obvious. is there any chance of a sudden, unexplained mechanical failure like that without a visible cause, or could it be some kind of internal component just snapping? what should they look for specifically?",
